@startuml
title Revisi Sequence Diagram — Pencarian Availability Villa
autonumber
actor Pengunjung
boundary "Next.js halaman /villas\ndan VillaSearchForm" as NextPage
control "Next.js route handler\n/api/lodgify/availability" as Availability
control "lib/lodgify" as LodgifyLib
entity "Lodgify REST API v2" as Lodgify

Pengunjung -> NextPage : Isi lokasi, tanggal, dan tamu
NextPage -> LodgifyLib : searchAvailableVillas(filters)
LodgifyLib -> Lodgify : GET property/search data
Lodgify --> LodgifyLib : properti dan data ketersediaan
LodgifyLib --> NextPage : daftar villa cocok / kosong
NextPage --> Pengunjung : tampilkan hasil atau pesan kosong

Pengunjung -> NextPage : Buka detail dan kalender
NextPage -> Availability : GET availability?propertyId&start&end
alt property ID atau tanggal tidak valid
  Availability --> NextPage : 400 validasi
else melewati rate limit
  Availability --> NextPage : 429 Too Many Requests
else valid
  Availability -> LodgifyLib : getAvailabilityMap(...)
  LodgifyLib -> Lodgify : GET availability/property calendar
  alt Lodgify berhasil
    Lodgify --> LodgifyLib : availability map
    LodgifyLib --> Availability : map + rangeAvailable
    Availability --> NextPage : 200 JSON
  else Lodgify gagal
    Lodgify --> LodgifyLib : error
    LodgifyLib --> Availability : error
    Availability --> NextPage : 500 pesan publik
  end
end
NextPage --> Pengunjung : kalender/validasi availability
note over Availability
Rate limit availability: 90 request/menit.
Tidak ada Laravel/MySQL pada alur ini.
end note
@enduml
